{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103678","id":2375511798,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Nl272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103678","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103678.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103678.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103678","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103678/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103678/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103678/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e821d780e3981939ce7baeb021ad009ca076f88f","number":103678,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve error message when trying to load scene as an animation library","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I was alerted to this usability issue here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jcLc5SJOR7s&t=445s\r\n\r\nBasically, we offer 3D model files as selectable items in the menu to load animation libraries, but this is only relevant for when a 3D model is imported as an AnimationLibrary. If a user tries to load a scene, they get this error:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"320\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 10 21 34 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a07994e-5b53-4175-8f36-a06f98706911\" />\r\n\r\nAfter the user sees this message, there is no information directing the user about how to get the animations from the 3D model file they selected, and they may stumble into a sub-optimal workflow such as copying the animations.\r\n\r\nThis PR improves the error message to check for 3D models imported as PackedScene, and gives the user a detailed explanation about what happened and how to get the animations from that file:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"960\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 10 18 16 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b74193c1-4dc5-4fb9-bd71-1e39286602a3\" />\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I improved the message when failing to load non-scene things:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"580\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 10 25 50 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea2f7549-d4c5-4b2b-aadb-ac20a99d3dae\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,